{"id":"6490c20309820655","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity.md","title":"FS的一致性与ω-不一致性","display":"cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity — FS的一致性与ω-不一致性","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity","aliases":["91-cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity","91-cor-FS-needs-omega","91-cor-FS-consistency-condition"],"display":"cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity — FS的一致性与ω-不一致性","depends_on":["[[91-df-omega-consistency]]","[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency]]","[[91-thm-FS-consistency]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity</span><span>91-cor-FS-needs-omega</span><span>91-cor-FS-consistency-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity — FS的一致性与ω-不一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8ad5058535b9125d\" href=\"?note=8ad5058535b9125d\" title=\"91-df-omega-consistency\">91-df-omega-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cda20fabbaa06580\" href=\"?note=cda20fabbaa06580\" title=\"91-thm-FS-omega-consistency\">91-thm-FS-omega-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ccf84662da3832c0\" href=\"?note=ccf84662da3832c0\" title=\"91-thm-FS-consistency\">91-thm-FS-consistency</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity-—-FS-的一致性与-$\\omega$-不一致性\">cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity — FS 的一致性与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致性</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}\\)</span> (Friedman-Sheard理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (所有有限层迭代真理理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\exists p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\exists p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega})\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega})\\)</span>\n(FS 矛盾证明到有限层理论的有效归约)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}\">\\(\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}FS\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}necessity}\n\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega})\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega})\n\\right]\n\\to\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{FS}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}FS\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}necessity}\n\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega})\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega})\n\\right]\n\\to\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{FS}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}FS\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}necessity}\n\\vdash\n\\neg\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(\\mathrm{FS}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}FS\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}necessity}\n\\vdash\n\\neg\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(\\mathrm{FS}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>推论的含义：\n标准 FS 可以句法一致，同时由 McGee 定理知其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致。\n所以“FS 一致当且仅当 PA <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致”是错误的；一致性与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性必须分开。</p>\n<p>FS 的算术后果与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 相同；其一致性可由该有限迭代\n层级的证明论解释支持。FS 并不包含对所有自指句子的全 T-schema，\n而是使用组合公理和 capture/release 规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity-—-FS-的一致性与-$\\omega$-不一致性","text":"cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity — FS 的一致性与 $\\omega$-不一致性","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"8ad5058535b9125d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-omega-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-FS-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"cda20fabbaa06580","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-FS-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"ccf84662da3832c0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-FS-consistency]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\exists p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega})","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}FS\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}necessity}\n\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega})\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega})\n\\right]\n\\to\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{FS}),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}FS\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}necessity}\n\\vdash\n\\neg\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(\\mathrm{FS}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}","display":false}],"bytes":1829,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["8ad5058535b9125d","cda20fabbaa06580","ccf84662da3832c0"]}